cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use a Vahtian tool in your research, please cite the specific tool you used (see https://vahtian.com/cite/)."
title: "Vahtian: human-first, auditable research-integrity tools"
abstract: >-
  Vahtian builds local-first, human-first research-integrity tools that assess
  whether a cited source supports a claim and record auditable decisions —
  CiteVahti, StudyVahti, MethodVahti, DictVahti, MatchVahti-Lite, ReviewVahti,
  ExtractVahti, GuidelineVahti, SynthVahti. It does not certify scientific truth.
type: software
